# Zenodo mints a per-version DOI and a concept DOI. Update both `doi` and the
# per-version entry below on every release; the concept DOI never changes and is
# what README.md badges. Order matters: citation generators take the first
# doi-type identifier, so the per-version DOI must stay first or exported BibTeX
# will point at the moving concept DOI instead of the archived code. See RELEASING.md.
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21897796"
identifiers:
